<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lincoln National upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lincoln National upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Edward Spehar upgraded Lincoln National Corp to outperform from neutral, citing the stock's price.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up two at 51-1/2.</p>
</text>
